      "id": "claim_db248350227d48b8bfb1acf49d9028e5",
      "statement": "The /new-project route wraps MultiStepFormNewProject in FormProvider with allowedFileTypes set to every FileType except TRACELINKS and INCONSISTENCIES, and the four-step wizard (Upload Files, Project Details, Configuration, Summary) validates each step via FormValidation functions rendered as DisplayErrors; the summary step re-validates earlier steps and the Calculate TraceLinks button is disabled while summary errors exist.",
