      "id": "claim_6515af6ee75948a1bab6ed3ed2bb6117",
      "statement": "On the final wizard step, handleSubmit calls fetchArdocoApi — which builds the multipart payload (projectName, additionalConfigs JSON with empty values filtered, type-specific inputCode/inputText/inputArchitectureModel plus inputArchitectureModelFormat) and POSTs to /api/{api_name lowercased}/start or /api/find-inconsistencies/start for SAD_SAM only, rejecting responses without requestId — then stores usedFiles and metadata via storeProjectFiles/storeProjectMetadata under the requestId and redirects to /view/{encodedId}?type={name}&inconsistencies={bool}.",
