    {
      "id": "claim_1a054fbadd6347d7b0858f2a5746d54c",
      "statement": "The /view/[id] page polls GET /api/get-result/{id} (with X-Target-API) every 5 seconds for up to 240 seconds: status OK returns the payload, ACCEPTED keeps polling, any other status throws an error carrying the backend message, and timeout throws a still-processing error; the initial poll uses the shared NavigationContext AbortController with AbortError swallowed, while the Retry path creates its own local AbortController that a later confirmed leave cannot cancel.",
